This product includes material derived from the following published standards.
Neither standard is distributed with this product.

1. The HL7 Version 2 standard, versions 2.3, 2.3.1, 2.4, 2.5.1, 2.6, 2.7.1 and
   2.8.2, published by Health Level Seven International.

   The code tables (Resources/tables/v*), data-type component definitions
   (Resources/datatypes/v*) and message-structure grammars
   (Resources/structures/v*) are machine-extracted from the published
   standard's PDF chapters and appendices. The segment definitions
   (Resources/schemas/) are extracted from the same chapters and then
   reviewed by hand. Group names for some pre-v2.5 message structures are
   read from the HL7 v2.xml schema bundles. Corrections to the extracted
   material cite the version, chapter, section and page of the standard.
   The generated Swift sources under Sources/HL7v2Kit/*/Generated/ are
   produced from these files.

