   Seven International. This product is not endorsed by Health Level Seven
   International.

2. HL7 Australia, "Australian Diagnostics and Referral Messaging -
   Localisation of HL7 Version 2.4", ADRM 2021.1
   (HL7AUSD-STD-OO-ADRM-2021.1), published by HL7 Australia.

   The AU locale code tables (Resources/tables/locale/au-adrm-2021/), the
   AU message-structure profiles (Resources/structures/profiles/au-adrm-2021/),
   the VMR OBX implementation table (Resources/profiles/au-adrm-2021/) and
   the HL7au profile rules the package applies are derived from that
   document. The locale tables and profile structures cite the section and
   page they come from.
